From 7fa308fc1a308ebb61ed3b2759bcd129f4fbd81e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: shota <monyuonyu@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 06:47:24 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 22/37] EED layer (1003) is big-endian and a name in DXF; DXF
 SPATIAL_FILTER; JSON NaN in vectors

- EED code 3 is the LAYER handle big-endian, as the entity handle 5:
  AutoCAD's sample_AC1015 has 00..00 08 F5 for its LAYER app_layer 8F5;
  it was read as 0xF508000000000000.
- out_dxf wrote the handle number for 1003, which is the layer name in
  DXF; in_dxf did not implement 1003 and now resolves the name.
- in_dxf: SPATIAL_FILTER has all its doubles as 40 (front clip z and both
  12-double matrices): a dedicated reader, the generic one garbled the
  clip vertices and filled the inverse matrix with NaN, and ACadSharp
  could not read it after DXF to DWG.
- out_json: NaN/Inf also in vectors (FIELD_VECTOR_N), one check in
  _VALUE_RD.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/decode.c   |   6 ++-
 src/encode.c   |   4 +-
 src/in_dxf.c   | 142 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 src/out_dxf.c  |  18 +++++--
 src/out_json.c |  32 +++++++----
 5 files changed, 186 insertions(+), 16 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/decode.c b/src/decode.c
